WEBVTT

00:06:29.619 --> 00:06:31.721
and going through the ups and downs

00:06:31.755 --> 00:06:33.890
and knowing that that's all a part of it,

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:35.659
you have to be patient with yourself,

00:06:35.692 --> 00:06:37.560
you have to give yourself grace

00:06:37.594 --> 00:06:39.996
and understand that you're
going to have good days,

00:06:39.996 --> 00:06:41.464
you're going to have bad days.

00:06:41.498 --> 00:06:43.366
But when it all comes down to it,

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:47.604
if you're keeping the idea
of healing in the forefront,

00:06:47.637 --> 00:06:53.143
then you can focus your energy
and your time into that process

00:06:53.176 --> 00:06:55.578
and going through it in a way
that is productive

00:06:55.612 --> 00:06:59.082
to your emotional well-being
in the future.

00:06:59.115 --> 00:07:00.250
CSB: Wonderful.